id=abk_fido_userspace
name=ABK FIDO Userspace
version=0.4.0
versionCode=3
author=ABK contributors
description=USB FIDO authenticator using standard HID gadget and a userspace daemon. Keys live under /data/adb/abk-fido; validated legacy metadata keys are imported once and preserved. Requires arm64, KernelSU root, and Companion 0.4.0 (versionCode 3) or newer for approval. No custom kernel module.
